The scroll of genocide seems to be an original invention for games like 
nethack rather than something from the fantasy literature or popular 
culture.

It allows the player to edit the game in a limited way and remove 
certain elements that they find annoying.

If I could find the right throne to sit on and be granted a wish that 
would change the theme of the game, I'd wish for the player to be more 
of an insurgent, fighting against a dark empire from the shadows.

Blazing through the dungeon slaughtering everything in sight ought to 
provoke a more centralized reaction, forcing the character to go to 
ground until the heat dies down.

Those limited use magical features would be there to be used in the 
service of maintaining the current world order and every one of them 
that you steal and use to subvert the powers that be would be a small 
victory.

